{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4180, "text": "Be careful now."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 9280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5480, "text": "A little more to the right. All right,\nnow let it down nice and easy."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 14060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12240, "text": "Is that about where you want it, sir?"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 16800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14520, "text": "Well, how about an inch and a half to\nthe left?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 22060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19560, "text": "Well, you guys aren't much on whimsy,\nare you?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 28080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23760, "text": "Ah, this is new, isn't it? Well, you\ncertainly are observant, Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 29460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28160, "text": "I've got to hand it to you."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 34440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32880, "text": "Goodie, it's Halloween again, isn't it,\nsir?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 36480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34720, "text": "Yep. You coming to my party?"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 40020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37000, "text": "Oh, you know, actually, I feel like I'm\ncoming down with something. I'm a little"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 42820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40020, "text": "stuffy. Yeah, but that's half your\ncharm."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 45380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43380, "text": "Look at this."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 49180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45600, "text": "See that, safe? This is going to be the\ncenterpiece of my magic act. I'm going"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 53940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49180, "text": "to do a trick so incredible, so amazing,\nit will boggle the human mind."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 55520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54520, "text": "Can we get this?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 61680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57720, "text": "Don't tell me that melonhead is going to\ndo the old escape from the safe trick."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 66470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64170, "text": "The produce in question is right here."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 70910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68350, "text": "Oh, you mean you're going to be inside\nthe safe?"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 72870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71150, "text": "Oh, and it's going to be locked and\neverything."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 75750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74750, "text": "Thrilling, sir."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 79810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76770, "text": "What's this party you guys are talking\nabout? I guess my invitation must have"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 80729, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79810, "text": "got lost in the mail."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 81730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80730, "text": "You can have mine."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 85670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83270, "text": "There's only one thing, though. I don't\nhave a costume or anything."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 88690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86110, "text": "Why don't you just have somebody carve\nopen your head and put a candle in it?"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 92690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91690, "text": "Very funny."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 94790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92910, "text": "Now, what kind of a moron would do\nsomething like that?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 101850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99810, "text": "Could somebody carve me some eyes?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 147320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145960, "text": "First case, sir."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 151080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147660, "text": "People versus Cowan, disturbing the\npeace and assault."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 153520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151560, "text": "I can't be held accountable."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 157600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 153740, "text": "An ethereal force violently expelled the\nessence from my body."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 159880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 158020, "text": "You tried the fake fajitas, huh?"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 168940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 162360, "text": "Your Honor, Ms. Cowan was arrested for\npummeling Mr. Gintz at the New Age Expo."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 174240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 170480, "text": "parties are trans channelers your honor\nthey claim that spiritual entities speak"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 178560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174240, "text": "through them from another realm you\nbelieve all this higher consciousness"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 185460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178560, "text": "huh so if i'm following this you two are\nkind"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 187300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185460, "text": "of like mouse pieces for uh"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 193740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187300, "text": "alien tap dancers"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 200400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199120, "text": "nothing of her own will."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 202740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201040, "text": "It is my doing."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 210280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 207620, "text": "Will the mystery guest sign in, please?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 217780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 211960, "text": "I am Darby, spirit teacher and seer from\nthe fourth astral plane."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 223320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218500, "text": "I demand punishment for this man who\nmocks the entire spirit world."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 228630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224970, "text": "Hey, Mr. Gantz, what did you do that\nticked these two off so much?"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 233490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229630, "text": "It's not my fault. When you're a trans\n-channeler, you can't choose who your"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 234448, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233490, "text": "entity will be."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 236250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234450, "text": "If I did, it sure wouldn't have been\nhim."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 237790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236790, "text": "Wouldn't have been whom?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 239330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238330, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 240930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239930, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 244530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243530, "text": "thank you, and good evening."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 249990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248890, "text": "Welcome to our show."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 253510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252510, "text": "Hold on."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 257920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255760, "text": "Did Ed Sullivan speak through you?"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 259540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258380, "text": "Well, I'm not Topo Gigio."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 264440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262600, "text": "Permission to smack the witness, Your\nHonor?"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 271340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267180, "text": "Please say we hold this one over until\nwe can get a cosmic reading from the"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 272580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271340, "text": "in the Bellevue Zone."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 274600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273600, "text": "Box them up."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 275660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274660, "text": "So ordered."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 278340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277000, "text": "Let there be lunch."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 280620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279540, "text": "Hi, Mr. Sullivan."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 283060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281720, "text": "Ed Sullivan's dead."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 285520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284040, "text": "His show's been off the air for years."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 288420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286380, "text": "Boy, timing is everything in this\nbusiness."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 291900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290540, "text": "How'd you like to make $100?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 297740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296480, "text": "I'd rather sit on a blender."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 301040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298220, "text": "Well, all you gotta do is sign this."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 304240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302040, "text": "Listen, buddy, I don't know who you are,\nbut why don't I take you and your stuff"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 305640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304240, "text": "and get... Oh, I'm known by many names."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 307580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306060, "text": "Lucifer, Beelzebub, Satan."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 310280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308000, "text": "Although it says Sue Bloomberg on my\nlicense."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 316020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312080, "text": "Enough about me. Let's talk about you\nand what you could do with one of these."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 319960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318720, "text": "Get four of those."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 323780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 322260, "text": "You want to give me this?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 329140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324100, "text": "Well, not exactly give. There is a\nformality. I need you to sign this"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 335780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331140, "text": "I, Dan Fielding, for the sum of $100, do\nhereby pledge my soul to eternal"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 336780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335780, "text": "damnation."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 340180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339180, "text": "Sounds good to me."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 356240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353079, "text": "This guy gave me $100 for my soul."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 357940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356780, "text": "Good idea."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 360020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358160, "text": "It was just taking up space anyway."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 367160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 363740, "text": "How to perform the amazing escape from a\nsafe trick."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 370740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367820, "text": "Step one, stuff yourself in a safe."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 372960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371960, "text": "Make sense?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 381370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380370, "text": "bad."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 385750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382470, "text": "Although I think a roommate is\ndefinitely out of the question."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 391190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388950, "text": "Hey, Ron, take a look at this."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 397530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395490, "text": "You know, a little water might help that\ngrow."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 403930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402670, "text": "I gotta go show the judge."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 434380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429640, "text": "really understand how truly helpless we\nare and how much we need the assistance"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 440520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434380, "text": "of someone greater than ourselves. So,\nplease, send Geraldo Rivera."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 447040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446040, "text": "Okay,"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 449800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448180, "text": "Harry, you're trapped in a small safe."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 456040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452420, "text": "Wait a minute. I got a flashlight in my\npocket. I'm a key ring, yeah."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 458820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456380, "text": "If I can just get my hand..."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 461229, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460229, "text": "Pocket. Okay."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 462790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461790, "text": "There's my flashlight."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 464550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463550, "text": "Okay,"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 469830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464750, "text": "now if I can get my hand out of my\npocket."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 472250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470230, "text": "And there."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 480470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478610, "text": "Boy, I got to get some odor eaters."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 486150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485150, "text": "There,"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 488530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486970, "text": "that's better."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 504170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501390, "text": "Now, stupid, you're going to work on\nthis safe."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 506190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504890, "text": "You're going to get your hands free."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 533590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532590, "text": "gonna be pretty."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 539710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538010, "text": "That's right. Drink now."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 542610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540050, "text": "You won't be getting much cold water\nwhere you're going."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 547910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543610, "text": "Of course, the heat might not bother you\nhaving grown up in bayou country."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 550330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549330, "text": "How did you know that?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 554210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550510, "text": "Oh, I know everything about you. You're\nsomething of a minor celebrity where I"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 555470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554210, "text": "come from. Oh, yeah?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 561260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557330, "text": "You know, The one that really had us\ngoing was the time you stole the necktie"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 563040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561260, "text": "off the corpse in the morgue."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 567080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565180, "text": "It went with my suit."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 574040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572560, "text": "Nobody saw me do that."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 579700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574260, "text": "Oh, just like nobody saw that little\nescapade with you and the meth ball girl"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 580700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579700, "text": "the bullpen."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 585600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582920, "text": "I was just showing them my slider."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 592600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 591600, "text": "The stadium was empty."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 597520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592920, "text": "Nobody... How the... Hey, hey, hey."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 600240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597840, "text": "I'm looking for a guy in red satin with\nhorns and a big tail."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 604920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603840, "text": "Give me five minutes."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 609040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608040, "text": "Knock, knock, sir."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 611560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610520, "text": "Huh, he's not here."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 614460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611880, "text": "Well, I'm sure he said to meet him here\nand we'll all go to lunch together."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 616160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614980, "text": "Then where the heck is he?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 620100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618540, "text": "So now you are trapped."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 627840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623180, "text": "Even if you were stupid enough to get\ntrapped in the safe, don't worry."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 631680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628060, "text": "You have an ample supply of air as long\nas you don't panic."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 638900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637900, "text": "Help!"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 640260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639260, "text": "Help!"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 646120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645120, "text": "Wait,"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 650820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649820, "text": "I could write a note."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 652080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650940, "text": "Yeah, I got a pen."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 685180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683660, "text": "I'm beginning to feel stood up."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 687300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685580, "text": "I'm beginning to feel starved."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 690960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689060, "text": "Why couldn't he have left us a message?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 694180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692680, "text": "Let's just send out the sandwiches."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 696440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695420, "text": "I'll take the orders."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 701260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699400, "text": "Shoot. I'll have a chili dog."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 703840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 702840, "text": "Chicken salad."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 706380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704260, "text": "Right. And I'll have the tongue and\njelly."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 713110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709020, "text": "Okay. That's a chili dog, chicken salad,\ntongue and jelly, and help, I'm trapped"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 714290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713110, "text": "in the safe. Love, Harry Stone."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 717150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716150, "text": "Anyone want fries?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 720130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718890, "text": "Help, I'm trapped in the safe."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 721510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720510, "text": "Harry's in the safe!"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 724010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722050, "text": "Harry! Can you hear me?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 726770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724830, "text": "It's okay, sir. We're here."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 728650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727650, "text": "Harry!"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 730510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729130, "text": "What do you want for lunch?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 736650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734550, "text": "What kind of safe company are you\nanyway?"}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 739660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737080, "text": "You already said he'd be down here, and\nit's been 20 minutes already."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 743580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740060, "text": "I got an idea. Why don't we drop the\nsafe out the window?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 749260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745900, "text": "I bet when that thing hit the sidewalk,\nit'd break wide open."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 751920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749920, "text": "Bull, so would Harry."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 754820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753420, "text": "Okay, it's got some flaws."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 771390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770090, "text": "While asleep, I'm gonna die."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 773950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772450, "text": "I got too much to live for."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 776670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774830, "text": "Too much to accomplish."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 782450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777950, "text": "Mainly, I don't want to become famous\nfor the stupid way I died."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 803090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802090, "text": "got to show for it, huh?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 806270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804750, "text": "Waterford dribble glasses."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 810070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807790, "text": "And a drawer full of chattering teeth."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 813430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811630, "text": "Well, my life's not a joke!"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 816650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815510, "text": "I help people."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 819010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817430, "text": "I've helped quite a few people."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 825050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820010, "text": "I make my mistakes, sure, but when they\ncome into my court, you bet they get a"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 829890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825050, "text": "fair shake. And they know that there is\na human being across the bench from"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 830890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829890, "text": "them."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 838850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832810, "text": "And I can say, honestly, that I have no"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 839850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838850, "text": "regrets."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 848130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845530, "text": "Except maybe that last cup of coffee."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 858890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853430, "text": "All right, Prince of Darkness, out where\nI can see you. You rang?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 862050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859870, "text": "What do you know about this phone\nmessage?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 865390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862610, "text": "While you were out, Uncle Luddy called\nand said, welcome aboard."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 868550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865750, "text": "So? My Uncle Luddy died 30 years ago in\na restaurant."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 870110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869110, "text": "31 years ago."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 872050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870830, "text": "In a brothel."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 877610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876110, "text": "Lucifer. Oh, pal."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 880170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878570, "text": "Buddy. Come here. Listen."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 884230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880830, "text": "We've had a lark, haven't we? But I, you\nknow, in good conscience, I really"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 886590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884230, "text": "can't keep this money. So why don't I\njust give it back to you? We'll call the"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 887489, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886590, "text": "whole thing off."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 890090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887490, "text": "No way, Fielding. Didn't you read the\nfine print?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 892260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890520, "text": "Our deal is forever."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 894920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892820, "text": "Here, try my deviled egg."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 899120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898120, "text": "All set."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 907840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906340, "text": "I'm getting drowsy."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 913420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 909540, "text": "That's a lack of oxygen to the brain."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 919960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918100, "text": "So this is how Bull feels."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 926210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924869, "text": "Somebody call for a safe technician?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 927870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926490, "text": "Well, it's about time."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 930810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928570, "text": "Relax, relax. I'll have them on two\nshakes."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 933850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 932850, "text": "Uh -oh."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 934950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933950, "text": "Uh -oh what?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 939670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935330, "text": "Well, this is an R -426. You gotta have\na carbon steel drill to get through"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 940670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939670, "text": "that, baby."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 942410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940710, "text": "You do have one, don't you?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 943770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942690, "text": "Sure, at the shop."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 946970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944570, "text": "There is a human being trapped inside\nhere."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 950640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948520, "text": "So you're saying you want me to drive\nback to the shop?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 955760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952360, "text": "Wait a second. I think I got a carbon\nsteel drill downstairs. Let me go check."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 958480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956640, "text": "Isn't there anything else you can do?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 963700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959480, "text": "Well, I suppose we could blast the thing\nopen, but... But what?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 966400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965060, "text": "It'll be real loud."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 969360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968240, "text": "Blow this sucker!"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 973780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972780, "text": "Knock, knock."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 976900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 975900, "text": "Who's that?"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 978160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977160, "text": "Harry."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 982820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981100, "text": "Hurry up and get me out of here."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 988060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 987060, "text": "Who are you?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 989320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988320, "text": "Your conscience."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 991000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989460, "text": "I'm the one who keeps you out of\ntrouble."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 995020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 991920, "text": "Well, where were you about an hour ago?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 999300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995680, "text": "So I took a nap. I never thought you'd\nbe stupid enough to try this."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 1002360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001360, "text": "Fool you."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 1007800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006360, "text": "How long do you think we got?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 1010100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008860, "text": "Let me put it this way."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 1012980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010460, "text": "I wouldn't start any Russian novels if I\nwere you."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 1017120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015320, "text": "Oh, Lord, I found that cotton spit!"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 1022260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020180, "text": "What are you, the heck of a time for\neverybody to take a lunch break?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 1024040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023020, "text": "Oh, well."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 1026940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025940, "text": "Yes!"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 1030060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027960, "text": "Who the heck left a silly party late\naround here?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 1039490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037930, "text": "Some people are so stupid."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 1047430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1042270, "text": "So the frog says, I don't know. It\nstarted off as a small wart on my fanny."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1054950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053670, "text": "That's good."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1060310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057430, "text": "I got one."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1065530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064530, "text": "Rabbi?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1068880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067880, "text": "A goat."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1073140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069580, "text": "And a banana."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1082620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077260, "text": "That reminds me."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1087260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083840, "text": "I got a dental appointment on Tuesday."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1091540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090080, "text": "Okay, all set."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1097560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095820, "text": "This isn't exactly child's play, you\nknow."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1101180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100180, "text": "One for the money."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1104040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102940, "text": "Two for the show."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1107160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104760, "text": "Three to beat your face into a pasty\ndough."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1109800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108800, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1116440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115440, "text": "Wait!"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1118500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1116760, "text": "I've got to warn you, this could be\nmessy."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1120420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118800, "text": "Is anyone wearing open -toed shoes?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1132570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130350, "text": "That's funny. Usually there's a few\nscraps left."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1136470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135130, "text": "You're doing just fine, sir."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1137810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136730, "text": "You're doing just fine."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1140470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138310, "text": "That's it. Keep walking those kinks out."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1142550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141110, "text": "You want to try it on your own now?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1149290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146390, "text": "Still got that old sense of humor, don't\nyou, sir?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1159790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156650, "text": "it was just another one of his stupid\npractical jokes."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1162610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161010, "text": "You gum."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1166390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163290, "text": "You invertebrate festering lowlife."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1170830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167370, "text": "Oh, don't try to charm me with one of\nyour stupid Frankenstein impressions"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1171830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170830, "text": "either."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1177730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172690, "text": "Do you realize the hell you put us\nthrough, you toad -eating mutant?"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1180350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179350, "text": "Sir?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1183050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181110, "text": "I was real worried about you."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1185670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183710, "text": "Now you better worry about you."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1192000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189660, "text": "My dummy's not allowed to play at your\nhouse anymore."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1198980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197580, "text": "I'll give you double your money back."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1202220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199200, "text": "No. Triple that. It was just a terrible\nmistake."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1203960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202460, "text": "Sorry. So long, Dan."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1205180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204160, "text": "See you real soon."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1206400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205400, "text": "Going down."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1210960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209180, "text": "No, no, no, no, no."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1213680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1212680, "text": "Hey, Dan."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1216960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213960, "text": "Why are we slobbering? all over the\nelevator."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1221400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219140, "text": "I sold myself to the devil."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1225560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223360, "text": "Oh, come on."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1228520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226100, "text": "Listen, I know it sounds crazy, but it's\ntrue."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1233500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228840, "text": "He knew every sleazy, disgusting,\ndegrading thing I've ever done my entire"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1235440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233760, "text": "Who else would know all that stuff?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1237680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236680, "text": "Me?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1269810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268110, "text": "must have been going about 70 when you\nhit."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1280050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279050, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1287870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284890, "text": "This has all been some sort of lesson,\nhasn't it?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1297140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294120, "text": "How about next time you just send me a\nstone tablet, huh?"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1302800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1299580, "text": "I mean, I get the message. Believe me, I\nget the message."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1309760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303180, "text": "Thou shalt not be a weenie and thou\nshalt live long and prosper."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1312440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311220, "text": "You have my word."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1314060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313060, "text": "I swear."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1318400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1314560, "text": "No more crazy stunts for Harry T. Stone."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1322340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320180, "text": "Well, that's a really, really big safe."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1332020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1327580, "text": "That reminds me of a trick done once on\nour show by that fine, fine master"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1333620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332020, "text": "illusionist, Rory Caputo."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1340320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336260, "text": "Oh, yeah, I remember him. He was the guy\nwho escaped from the safe when it was"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1342020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340320, "text": "down in a shark tank."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1343340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342260, "text": "That must have been incredible."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1345100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343740, "text": "Well, not if you know how it was done."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1347660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346400, "text": "He told you how he did it?"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1350460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347940, "text": "I promised Rory I would take that secret\nto my grave."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1351760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350760, "text": "And I did."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1356380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354620, "text": "Stop by sometime. I'll show you how it's\ndone."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1363150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361290, "text": "Oh, come on. Just one more."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1366510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1365510, "text": "Hey,"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1371090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1368590, "text": "let your conscience be your guide."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1374510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1373510, "text": "Gotcha."}
